    <string name="ai_cap_amount">Limit per month</string>
    <string name="ai_spend_estimate_note">Estimated from list prices, as a safety net. Gemini search fees aren\'t included. Your provider\'s bill is what counts.</string>
    <string name="ai_settings_privacy">What is sent</string>
    <string name="ai_settings_privacy_body">Only what the feature you press needs: the exercise, the workout and its exercises, or a summary of your last 8 weeks (dates relative to today, sets, weights, no notes). Answers are shown for you to accept or ignore; the AI never changes your data by itself. AI answers can be wrong and are not medical advice.</string>
